<%- include('partials/head', { description: 'Two-day live SAT and ACT math bootcamp on Saturday and Sunday, small group, with a personal study plan.' }) %>
<section class="page">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="background:#e9efff;color:#1d43a8;border-color:#c7d6fb">Optional next step after the free class</span>
    <h1>SAT/ACT Math Bootcamp</h1>
    <p class="lead" style="color:var(--muted)">A small live group on Zoom, two sessions of <%= cfg.bootcamp.sessionMinutes %> minutes: one on Saturday and one on Sunday. Limited to <%= cfg.bootcamp.capacity %> students so every student gets feedback.</p>

    <div class="card" style="margin:24px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:20px;align-items:center">
      <div>
        <h3 style="margin:0">$<%= cfg.bootcamp.price %> per student</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="margin:6px 0 0"><%= cfg.bootcamp.dates %></p>
      </div>
      <% if (cfg.stripeLink) { %>
        <a class="btn btn-accent" href="<%= cfg.stripeLink %>" rel="noopener">Enroll now</a>
      <% } else { %>
        <a class="btn btn-accent" href="mailto:<%= biz.email %>?subject=Bootcamp%20enrollment">Email to enroll</a>
      <% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="guarantee">
      <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span>
      <p><strong>Risk-free:</strong> ask for a full refund any time before the end of Saturday's session, no questions asked. See the <a href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="muted small"><strong>Topics covered:</strong> linear equations and systems &middot; inequalities and word problems &middot; quadratics and other functions &middot; exponential growth &middot; ratios, rates and percents &middot; data analysis and statistics &middot; geometry and trigonometry essentials &middot; digital SAT calculator strategies &middot; timed-section pacing</p>

    <h2>What you get</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Two live sessions on Zoom, <%= cfg.bootcamp.sessionMinutes %> minutes each, on Saturday and Sunday</li>
      <li>A strategy playbook and a formula and common-mistakes sheet</li>
      <li>Practice sets by question type, with worked explanations</li>
      <li>A written 4-week study plan built from your own mistakes</li>
      <li>A login to the student area for materials and to send questions to your tutor</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Why a capped, live group instead of a self-paced course</h2>
    <p>Big platforms hand every student the same pre-recorded videos in the same order. Here, a real tutor watches the group work problems live, corrects mistakes in the moment, and builds your study plan from the errors you actually made, not a generic checklist. Capping the bootcamp at <%= cfg.bootcamp.capacity %> students is what makes that possible.</p>

    <h2>Your tutor</h2>
    <div class="tutor" style="align-items:flex-start">
      <div class="avatar" aria-hidden="true"><%= biz.tutorName.split(' ').map(function (w) { return w.charAt(0); }).join('').slice(0, 2).toUpperCase() %></div>
      <div>
        <p style="margin-bottom:2px"><strong><%= biz.tutorName %></strong></p>
        <% if (biz.tutorCredentials) { %><p class="small muted" style="margin-bottom:12px"><%= biz.tutorCredentials %></p><% } %>
        <p class="muted"><%= biz.tutorBio %></p>
        <% if (cfg.tutorRating.value) { %>
          <a href="<%= cfg.tutorRating.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="badge" style="text-decoration:none;font-size:0.85rem;padding:6px 14px">
            &#9733; <%= cfg.tutorRating.value %>/5 from <%= cfg.tutorRating.count %> tutoring students on <%= cfg.tutorRating.source %>
          </a>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Schedule</h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Session</th><th>Focus</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Saturday, first half</td><td>Algebra: linear equations, systems, inequalities, word problems</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Saturday, second half</td><td>Advanced math: quadratics, functions, exponentials, calculator shortcuts</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Sunday, first half</td><td>Data analysis, ratios and percents, geometry and trigonometry essentials</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Sunday, second half</td><td>Timed practice module, review of errors, and your study plan</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="small muted">Each session includes a short break. Times are in <%= cfg.tzLabel %>.</p>

    <h2>Our promise and our limits</h2>
    <p>You can get a full refund if you ask before the end of the Saturday session. See the <a href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a>. We do not guarantee a particular score: results depend on each student's effort and starting point.</p>

    <h2>Already enrolled?</h2>
    <p><a href="/login">Log in to the student area</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
